d** the cheese. **Cook** for three minutes. Then **eat**!","Careful: **there isn’t** time to waste. Breakfast is waiting."],"kicker":"RECIPE","by":"From a quick-cooking book","gloss":[["break","quebrar"],["cheese","queijo"],["waste","desperdiçar"],["careful","cuidado"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"There are three eggs.","ans":"T","why":"“three eggs.”"},{"q":"There isn’t any cheese.","ans":"F","why":"“There is some cheese.”"},{"q":"You cook for three minutes.","ans":"T","why":"“three minutes.”"},{"q":"The omelette has meat.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“break” (the eggs) means…","opts":["quebrar","mexer","lavar"],"ans":0,"why":"break = quebrar."},{"q":"“waste” means…","opts":["desperdiçar","guardar","comprar"],"ans":0,"why":"waste = desperdiçar."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"There is / are: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Para…","Use","Exemplo"],"rows":[["existe","There is / are","**There are three eggs.**"],["não existe","There isn’t / aren’t","**There isn’t any milk.**"],["pergunta","Is / Are there…?","**Is there any cheese?**"]],"cap":"Produção"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Contável × incontável","body":"**There are eggs** (contável). **There is cheese** (incontável)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ three eggs.","a":"There are","why":"plural."},{"s":"___ some cheese.","a":"There is","why":"incontável."},{"s":"___ any milk? — No, there ___ .","a":["Is there","isn’t"],"why":"incontável."},{"s":"___ on the stove. (turn)","a":"Turn","why":"turn on."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["egg","ovo"],["cheese","queijo"],["stove","fogão"],["fridge","geladeira"],["minute","minuto"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["there","is","Yes"],"ans":"Yes the